{"original_branch": "main", "new_branch": "main", "files": [{"path": "Dockerfile", "additions": 2, "deletions": 2, "hunks": [{"header": "@@ -16,7 +16,7 @@", "lines": [{"type": "context", "content": ""}, {"type": "context", "content": "COPY --from=build /build/target/app.jar app.jar"}, {"type": "context", "content": ""}, {"type": "removed", "content": "ENV SERVER_PORT=21552"}, {"type": "removed", "content": "EXPOSE 21552"}, {"type": "added", "content": "ENV SERVER_PORT=25084"}, {"type": "added", "content": "EXPOSE 25084"}, {"type": "context", "content": ""}, {"type": "context", "content": "ENTRYPOINT [\"java\", \"-jar\", \"/app/app.jar\"]"}]}]}, {"path": "README.md", "additions": 6, "deletions": 6, "hunks": [{"header": "@@ -47,7 +47,7 @@", "lines": [{"type": "context", "content": "```"}, {"type": "context", "content": ""}, {"type": "context", "content": "This loads `.env_3d186026-a490-405e-9a9b-e15f8ab6d64b`, builds the jar with the Maven"}, {"type": "removed", "content": "Wrapper, and starts the app on port `21552` (override with `SERVER_PORT=xxxx"}, {"type": "added", "content": "Wrapper, and starts the app on port `25084` (override with `SERVER_PORT=xxxx"}, {"type": "context", "content": "./start.sh`)."}, {"type": "context", "content": ""}, {"type": "context", "content": "On Windows, use `start.bat`."}]}, {"header": "@@ -65,8 +65,8 @@", "lines": [{"type": "context", "content": ""}, {"type": "context", "content": "## API Documentation"}, {"type": "context", "content": ""}, {"type": "removed", "content": "- Swagger UI: `http://localhost:21552/docs`"}, {"type": "removed", "content": "- OpenAPI JSON: `http://localhost:21552/api-docs`"}, {"type": "added", "content": "- Swagger UI: `http://localhost:25084/docs`"}, {"type": "added", "content": "- OpenAPI JSON: `http://localhost:25084/api-docs`"}, {"type": "context", "content": ""}, {"type": "context", "content": "Every endpoint is documented there with request/response schemas. To try an endpoint"}, {"type": "context", "content": "that requires authentication, first call `POST /api/v1/auth/login`, copy the `token`"}]}, {"header": "@@ -127,7 +127,7 @@", "lines": [{"type": "context", "content": "Register:"}, {"type": "context", "content": ""}, {"type": "context", "content": "```bash"}, {"type": "removed", "content": "curl -X POST http://localhost:21552/api/v1/auth/register \\"}, {"type": "added", "content": "curl -X POST http://localhost:25084/api/v1/auth/register \\"}, {"type": "context", "content": "  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\"}, {"type": "context", "content": "  -d '{\"name\":\"Jane Doe\",\"email\":\"jane@example.com\",\"password\":\"Secret123\",\"neighborhood\":\"Maple Heights\",\"phone\":\"555-1111\"}'"}, {"type": "context", "content": "```"}]}, {"header": "@@ -135,7 +135,7 @@", "lines": [{"type": "context", "content": "Login:"}, {"type": "context", "content": ""}, {"type": "context", "content": "```bash"}, {"type": "removed", "content": "curl -X POST http://localhost:21552/api/v1/auth/login \\"}, {"type": "added", "content": "curl -X POST http://localhost:25084/api/v1/auth/login \\"}, {"type": "context", "content": "  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\"}, {"type": "context", "content": "  -d '{\"email\":\"jane@example.com\",\"password\":\"Secret123\"}'"}, {"type": "context", "content": "```"}]}, {"header": "@@ -143,7 +143,7 @@", "lines": [{"type": "context", "content": "Create a tool (replace `$TOKEN`):"}, {"type": "context", "content": ""}, {"type": "context", "content": "```bash"}, {"type": "removed", "content": "curl -X POST http://localhost:21552/api/v1/tools \\"}, {"type": "added", "content": "curl -X POST http://localhost:25084/api/v1/tools \\"}, {"type": "context", "content": "  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\"}, {"type": "context", "content": "  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\"}, {"type": "context", "content": "  -d '{\"name\":\"Circular Saw\",\"category\":\"Power Tools\",\"description\":\"7 1/4 inch\",\"condition\":\"GOOD\",\"available\":true}'"}]}]}, {"path": "ai_changes.md", "additions": 71, "deletions": 0, "hunks": [{"header": "@@ -0,0 +1,71 @@", "lines": [{"type": "added", "content": "COMMIT_MESSAGE: Reconfigure server port/DB/JWT defaults for target environment and add full API test suite"}, {"type": "added", "content": ""}, {"type": "added", "content": "## Features Added"}, {"type": "added", "content": ""}, {"type": "added", "content": "The project already implemented the full requested feature set (User, Tool, BorrowRequest,"}, {"type": "added", "content": "Reservation, Review, Notification entities; tool listing; borrow request lifecycle;"}, {"type": "added", "content": "reservations; return tracking; two-way reviews/ratings; notifications; admin monitoring;"}, {"type": "added", "content": "JWT auth; user data isolation; tool availability/stock rules; overdue detection). This run"}, {"type": "added", "content": "focused on adapting the existing implementation to the target deployment environment and"}, {"type": "added", "content": "verifying it end-to-end:"}, {"type": "added", "content": ""}, {"type": "added", "content": "- Re-pointed the app to the target server port (25084) and resolved PostgreSQL database,"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  making both overridable via environment variables with safe local defaults."}, {"type": "added", "content": "- Externalized the JWT signing secret behind a proper `jwt.secret` property (was previously"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  read directly from a raw `JWT_SECRET` env var with no default, which would fail to start"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  in this environment)."}, {"type": "added", "content": "- Updated JWT expiry to 60 minutes per the target auth configuration (was 30 minutes)."}, {"type": "added", "content": "- Added a comprehensive curl-based end-to-end test suite exercising every documented"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  endpoint (auth, users, tools, borrow-requests, reservations, reviews, notifications,"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  admin, health)."}, {"type": "added", "content": ""}, {"type": "added", "content": "No new entities, endpoints, or business rules were added since the existing project already"}, {"type": "added", "content": "fully covers every item in the requested feature list (tool listing, borrow requests,"}, {"type": "added", "content": "reservations, return tracking, two-way reviews/ratings, notifications, admin monitoring,"}, {"type": "added", "content": "JWT auth, user isolation, availability/stock rules, overdue detection via a scheduled job)."}, {"type": "added", "content": ""}, {"type": "added", "content": "## Files Modified"}, {"type": "added", "content": ""}, {"type": "added", "content": "- `src/main/resources/application.properties` \u2014 `server.port` now `${SERVER_PORT:25084}`;"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  `spring.datasource.url/username/password` now default to the resolved local PostgreSQL"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  database (`jdbc:postgresql://localhost:5432/gen_9bb072199192`, `myuser`/`mypassword`)"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  when env vars are absent; added `jwt.secret=${JWT_SECRET:<dev-default>}` property;"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  `jwt.expiration-ms` changed from `1800000` (30 min) to `3600000` (60 min)."}, {"type": "added", "content": "- `src/main/java/com/example/app/security/JwtUtil.java` \u2014 reads `${jwt.secret}` instead of"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  the raw `${JWT_SECRET}` env var directly, so the secret now has a safe local default and"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  follows the project's standard `application.properties` externalization pattern."}, {"type": "added", "content": "- `Dockerfile` \u2014 default `SERVER_PORT`/`EXPOSE` changed from `21552` to `25084`."}, {"type": "added", "content": "- `docker-compose.yml` \u2014 app/db now use port `25084`, and the Postgres database name matches"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  the resolved database (`gen_9bb072199192`) instead of the original unreachable one."}, {"type": "added", "content": "- `start.sh`, `start.bat` \u2014 default `SERVER_PORT` changed from `21552` to `25084`."}, {"type": "added", "content": "- `README.md` \u2014 all example URLs/ports updated from `21552` to `25084`."}, {"type": "added", "content": ""}, {"type": "added", "content": "## Files Added"}, {"type": "added", "content": ""}, {"type": "added", "content": "- `api_tests/test_full_lifecycle.sh` \u2014 end-to-end curl test suite covering: register"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  (including duplicate-email rejection), login (including bad-password rejection),"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  get/update current user, create/search/get/edit tool, unauthorized/forbidden checks,"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  borrow-request create (including own-tool rejection), list (borrower/owner roles), get,"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  approve (including non-owner rejection), reject path is exercised implicitly via business"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  rules, activate, return, tool availability flips (unavailable on approve, available again"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  on return), reservation list/get/update, two-way reviews (both directions + duplicate"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  rejection), notifications list/mark-read, admin overdue-users/flagged-tools, delete-with-"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  history rejection (400 by design) vs delete-without-history success (204) + 404"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  confirmation, and the actuator health check."}, {"type": "added", "content": "- `start_0bcea87584ee7ad7.sh` \u2014 platform deployment boot script (not committed to git)."}, {"type": "added", "content": ""}, {"type": "added", "content": "## Secrets Moved"}, {"type": "added", "content": ""}, {"type": "added", "content": "- `JWT_SECRET` (previously injected directly into `JwtUtil` via `@Value(\"${JWT_SECRET}\")`"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  with no default) -> `application.properties` key `jwt.secret=${JWT_SECRET:dev-default-jwt-signing-secret-change-me-please-32-bytes-min}`."}, {"type": "added", "content": ""}, {"type": "added", "content": "## DB URLs Resolved"}, {"type": "added", "content": ""}, {"type": "added", "content": "- `jdbc:postgresql://db:5432/gen_601cfe67f33b` -> `jdbc:postgresql://localhost:5432/gen_9bb072199192`"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  (original Docker-network host `db` was unreachable outside compose; replaced with the"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  pre-resolved local PostgreSQL database, wired as the default for `spring.datasource.url`,"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  and mirrored into `docker-compose.yml`'s Postgres service definition)."}, {"type": "added", "content": ""}, {"type": "added", "content": "## Test Results Summary"}, {"type": "added", "content": ""}, {"type": "added", "content": "44 PASSED, 0 FAILED, 0 SKIPPED (see `api_tests/test_full_lifecycle.sh`)"}]}]}, {"path": "api_tests/test_full_lifecycle.sh", "additions": 329, "deletions": 0, "hunks": [{"header": "@@ -0,0 +1,329 @@", "lines": [{"type": "added", "content": "#!/bin/bash"}, {"type": "added", "content": "# Full lifecycle test for Neighborhood ToolShare Backend"}, {"type": "added", "content": "# Covers: auth, users, tools, borrow-requests, reservations, reviews, notifications, admin"}, {"type": "added", "content": ""}, {"type": "added", "content": "BASE_URL=\"http://localhost:25084\""}, {"type": "added", "content": "RESULTS_FILE=\"/tmp/test_results.log\""}, {"type": "added", "content": "> \"$RESULTS_FILE\""}, {"type": "added", "content": ""}, {"type": "added", "content": "PASS_COUNT=0"}, {"type": "added", "content": "FAIL_COUNT=0"}, {"type": "added", "content": ""}, {"type": "added", "content": "record() {"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  local name=\"$1\" code=\"$2\" expected=\"$3\" extra=\"$4\""}, {"type": "added", "content": "  if [ \"$code\" = \"$expected\" ]; then"}, {"type": "added", "content": "    echo \"PASS|$name|$code|$extra\" >> \"$RESULTS_FILE\""}, {"type": "added", "content": "    PASS_COUNT=$((PASS_COUNT+1))"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  else"}, {"type": "added", "content": "    echo \"FAIL|$name|$code (expected $expected)|$extra\" >> \"$RESULTS_FILE\""}, {"type": "added", "content": "    FAIL_COUNT=$((FAIL_COUNT+1))"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  fi"}, {"type": "added", "content": "}"}, {"type": "added", "content": ""}, {"type": "added", "content": "RAND=$RANDOM"}, {"type": "added", "content": "OWNER_EMAIL=\"owner_${RAND}@example.com\""}, {"type": "added", "content": "BORROWER_EMAIL=\"borrower_${RAND}@example.com\""}, {"type": "added", "content": "PASSWORD=\"Secret123\""}, {"type": "added", "content": ""}, {"type": "added", "content": "echo \"== Register owner ==\""}, {"type": "added", "content": "REG_OWNER=$(curl -s --max-time 60 -w \"\\n%{http_code}\" -X POST \"$BASE_URL/api/v1/auth/register\" \\"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  -d \"{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Owner User\\\",\\\"email\\\":\\\"$OWNER_EMAIL\\\",\\\"password\\\":\\\"$PASSWORD\\\",\\\"neighborhood\\\":\\\"Maple Heights\\\",\\\"phone\\\":\\\"555-1111\\\"}\")"}, {"type": "added", "content": "OWNER_CODE=$(echo \"$REG_OWNER\" | tail -1)"}, {"type": "added", "content": "OWNER_BODY=$(echo \"$REG_OWNER\" | sed '$d')"}, {"type": "added", "content": "OWNER_TOKEN=$(echo \"$OWNER_BODY\" | grep -o '\"token\":\"[^\"]*\"' | head -1 | cut -d'\"' -f4)"}, {"type": "added", "content": "record \"POST /auth/register (owner)\" \"$OWNER_CODE\" \"201\" \"$OWNER_BODY\""}, {"type": "added", "content": ""}, {"type": "added", "content": "echo \"== Register borrower ==\""}, {"type": "added", "content": "REG_BORROWER=$(curl -s --max-time 60 -w \"\\n%{http_code}\" -X POST \"$BASE_URL/api/v1/auth/register\" \\"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  -d \"{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Borrower User\\\",\\\"email\\\":\\\"$BORROWER_EMAIL\\\",\\\"password\\\":\\\"$PASSWORD\\\",\\\"neighborhood\\\":\\\"Maple Heights\\\",\\\"phone\\\":\\\"555-2222\\\"}\")"}, {"type": "added", "content": "BORROWER_CODE=$(echo \"$REG_BORROWER\" | tail -1)"}, {"type": "added", "content": "BORROWER_BODY=$(echo \"$REG_BORROWER\" | sed '$d')"}, {"type": "added", "content": "BORROWER_TOKEN=$(echo \"$BORROWER_BODY\" | grep -o '\"token\":\"[^\"]*\"' | head -1 | cut -d'\"' -f4)"}, {"type": "added", "content": "BORROWER_ID=$(echo \"$BORROWER_BODY\" | grep -o '\"userId\":[0-9]*' | head -1 | cut -d':' -f2)"}, {"type": "added", "content": "record \"POST /auth/register (borrower)\" \"$BORROWER_CODE\" \"201\" \"$BORROWER_BODY\""}, {"type": "added", "content": ""}, {"type": "added", "content": "echo \"== Register duplicate email (expect 400/409) ==\""}, {"type": "added", "content": "DUP=$(curl -s --max-time 60 -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" -X POST \"$BASE_URL/api/v1/auth/register\" \\"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  -d \"{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Dup\\\",\\\"email\\\":\\\"$OWNER_EMAIL\\\",\\\"password\\\":\\\"$PASSWORD\\\"}\")"}, {"type": "added", "content": "if [ \"$DUP\" = \"400\" ] || [ \"$DUP\" = \"409\" ]; then"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  record \"POST /auth/register (duplicate - reject)\" \"$DUP\" \"$DUP\" \"correctly rejected\""}, {"type": "added", "content": "else"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  record \"POST /auth/register (duplicate - reject)\" \"$DUP\" \"400\" \"expected rejection\""}, {"type": "added", "content": "fi"}, {"type": "added", "content": ""}, {"type": "added", "content": "echo \"== Login owner ==\""}, {"type": "added", "content": "LOGIN=$(curl -s --max-time 60 -w \"\\n%{http_code}\" -X POST \"$BASE_URL/api/v1/auth/login\" \\"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  -d \"{\\\"email\\\":\\\"$OWNER_EMAIL\\\",\\\"password\\\":\\\"$PASSWORD\\\"}\")"}, {"type": "added", "content": "LOGIN_CODE=$(echo \"$LOGIN\" | tail -1)"}, {"type": "added", "content": "LOGIN_BODY=$(echo \"$LOGIN\" | sed '$d')"}, {"type": "added", "content": "record \"POST /auth/login (owner)\" \"$LOGIN_CODE\" \"200\" \"$LOGIN_BODY\""}, {"type": "added", "content": ""}, {"type": "added", "content": "echo \"== Login wrong password (expect 401) ==\""}, {"type": "added", "content": "BADLOGIN=$(curl -s --max-time 60 -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" -X POST \"$BASE_URL/api/v1/auth/login\" \\"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  -d \"{\\\"email\\\":\\\"$OWNER_EMAIL\\\",\\\"password\\\":\\\"wrongpass\\\"}\")"}, {"type": "added", "content": "record \"POST /auth/login (wrong password - reject)\" \"$BADLOGIN\" \"401\" \"expected rejection\""}, {"type": "added", "content": ""}, {"type": "added", "content": "echo \"== GET /users/me (owner) ==\""}, {"type": "added", "content": "ME=$(curl -s --max-time 60 -w \"\\n%{http_code}\" \"$BASE_URL/api/v1/users/me\" -H \"Authorization: Bearer $OWNER_TOKEN\")"}, {"type": "added", "content": "ME_CODE=$(echo \"$ME\" | tail -1)"}, {"type": "added", "content": "record \"GET /users/me (owner)\" \"$ME_CODE\" \"200\" \"\""}, {"type": "added", "content": ""}, {"type": "added", "content": "echo \"== GET /users/me no token (expect 401/403) ==\""}, {"type": "added", "content": "NOAUTH=$(curl -s --max-time 60 -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" \"$BASE_URL/api/v1/users/me\")"}, {"type": "added", "content": "if [ \"$NOAUTH\" = \"401\" ] || [ \"$NOAUTH\" = \"403\" ]; then"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  record \"GET /users/me (no auth - reject)\" \"$NOAUTH\" \"$NOAUTH\" \"correctly rejected\""}, {"type": "added", "content": "else"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  record \"GET /users/me (no auth - reject)\" \"$NOAUTH\" \"401\" \"expected rejection\""}, {"type": "added", "content": "fi"}, {"type": "added", "content": ""}, {"type": "added", "content": "echo \"== PUT /users/me ==\""}, {"type": "added", "content": "UPDATEME=$(curl -s --max-time 60 -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" -X PUT \"$BASE_URL/api/v1/users/me\" \\"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $OWNER_TOKEN\" -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  -d '{\"name\":\"Owner Updated\",\"neighborhood\":\"Oak Grove\",\"phone\":\"555-9999\"}')"}, {"type": "added", "content": "record \"PUT /users/me\" \"$UPDATEME\" \"200\" \"\""}, {"type": "added", "content": ""}, {"type": "added", "content": "echo \"== POST /tools (owner creates tool) ==\""}, {"type": "added", "content": "TOOL=$(curl -s --max-time 60 -w \"\\n%{http_code}\" -X POST \"$BASE_URL/api/v1/tools\" \\"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $OWNER_TOKEN\" -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  -d '{\"name\":\"Circular Saw\",\"category\":\"Power Tools\",\"description\":\"7 1/4 inch\",\"condition\":\"GOOD\",\"available\":true}')"}, {"type": "added", "content": "TOOL_CODE=$(echo \"$TOOL\" | tail -1)"}, {"type": "added", "content": "TOOL_BODY=$(echo \"$TOOL\" | sed '$d')"}, {"type": "added", "content": "TOOL_ID=$(echo \"$TOOL_BODY\" | grep -o '\"id\":[0-9]*' | head -1 | cut -d':' -f2)"}, {"type": "added", "content": "record \"POST /tools\" \"$TOOL_CODE\" \"201\" \"$TOOL_BODY\""}, {"type": "added", "content": ""}, {"type": "added", "content": "echo \"== GET /tools (search, paginated) ==\""}, {"type": "added", "content": "SEARCH=$(curl -s --max-time 60 -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" \"$BASE_URL/api/v1/tools?category=Power%20Tools&available=true\" \\"}, {"type": "added", "content": "  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $BORROWER_TOKEN\")"}, {"type": "added", "content": "record \"GET /tools (search)\" \"$SEARCH\" \"200\" \"\""}, {"type": "added", "content": ""}, {"type": "added", "content": "echo \"== GET /tools/mine (owner) ==\""}, {"type": "added", "content": "MINE=$(curl -s --max-time 60 -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" \"